 ### Inputs and Outputs
-- **Input**: An unstructured mesh (cells, faces, vertices), a viewpoint, and an image resolution ($w \times h$).
-- **Output**: A total ordering sequence of cells $b = c_{im} < c_{im-1} < \dots < c_{i1} < c_{i0} = a$, where $b$ comes before $a$ in the sorted sequence (i.e., $b$ is rendered after $a$ in back-to-front compositing) [S2].
+- **Input**: An unstructured mesh (cells, faces, vertices), a viewpoint, and an image resolution ($w \times h$) [S2, S3, unofficial].
+- **Output**: A total ordering sequence of cells $b = c_{im} < c_{im-1} < \dots < c_{i1} < c_{i0} = a$, where $b$ comes before $a$ in the sorted sequence [S2, unofficial].
 
