 ## Background
-SXMPVO was introduced by Cook, Silva, and Max in 2004 [S2, S3]. It builds on MPVO [S2, S3] and XMPVO [S2]. ZSWEEP is a related algorithm by Mitchell, Silva, and Farias (2000) that uses a sweep plane approach [S1]. SXMPVO is used for volume rendering systems based on cell projection of unstructured data, specifically tetrahedral and zoo meshes [S2, S3].
